### Summary of Changes

1. **`isBinaryFile` Directory Check & Error Handling**:
   - Updated the implementation in `packages/core/src/utils/fileUtils.ts` ([fileUtils.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_21527/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/fileUtils.ts)) to proactively perform an `fsPromises.stat` check on the target path first.
   - If the path is a directory, `isBinaryFile` returns `false` immediately, avoiding calls to `fs.promises.open`.
   - The catch block was updated to suppress debug warning logs specifically for the `EISDIR` error code on directories.

2. **`ReadManyFilesTool` Directory Filtering**:
   - Updated the implementation in `packages/core/src/tools/read-many-files.ts` ([read-many-files.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_21527/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/tools/read-many-files.ts)) inside the `sortedFiles.map(...)` promise handler.
   - Checked each file path via `fsPromises.stat`. If `!stats.isFile()` holds true, the processor skips file type detection and file content reading, preventing directories from causing internal crashes or invalid reads.

3. **`atCommandProcessor` Path Expansion Guards**:
   - Updated the implementation of path expansion in `packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/atCommandProcessor.ts` ([atCommandProcessor.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_21527/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/atCommandProcessor.ts)).
   - Introduced a `visitedPaths` `Set<string>` utilizing absolute `fs.realpath` names. This tracking guards against processing cycles and recursive folders (e.g. symlinks, loops, or traversing duplicate pathways infinitely).
   - Replaced backslashes in directory `pathSpec` with forward slashes for full cross-platform glob matching consistency in the terminal.

4. **Robust Testing Assertions**:
   - Added a new unit test in `packages/core/src/utils/fileUtils.test.ts` ([fileUtils.test.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/small_triaged_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_21527/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/fileUtils.test.ts)) asserting that `isBinaryFile` successfully detects a directory path and returns `false` safely without logging warnings or errors.

### Verification

All targeted tests in the repository pass with **100% success** (134 tests passed cleanly, 0 failures):
- **Core Utility Tests**: `packages/core/src/utils/fileUtils.test.ts` ran and passed all 87 tests.
- **CLI Command Processor Tests**: `packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/atCommandProcessor.test.ts` ran and passed all 47 tests.
